Hi, Sohail,

Here's a one-liner:

> x <- c("abc", "ffd", "sad")
> sapply(lapply(x, function(x) rev(substring(x, 1:nchar(x), 
1:nchar(x)))), paste, collapse = "")

[1] "cba" "dff" "das"

HTH,

--sundar

