Sichong,

Regarding your Object Explorer question,
try checking the properties of the OE folder.

In the OE left pane, right-click the desired folder,
select 'Folder...' from the context menu.

In the 'Folder' tab, 'Data Objects' group,
enable the 'Data' check box,

In the 'Advanced' tab, 'Database Filter' group,
check that the relevant timeseries classes are selected,
(ctrl+click to add more)
and enable the 'Include Derived Classes' check box.

You can choose the '(All)' option in the filter drop-
down list to avoid missing anything, although this
might make things a bit cluttered.

